Let first be a list of 2, 4, and 3.
Let second be a list of 5, 6, and 4.
Let result be an empty list of whole numbers.
Let position be 0.
Let carry be 0.
Let first last be the last position of first.
Let second last be the last position of second.
Repeat while position is at most first last or position is at most second last or carry is 1.
Let sum be carry.
If position is at most first last, set sum to sum plus item position of first.
If position is at most second last, set sum to sum plus item position of second.
Append sum modulo 10 to result.
Set carry to sum divided by 10.
Add 1 to position.

For each value in result, print value.
